{"sample_id": "kn-005", "sut_id": "mock-weak", "score": 1, "notes": "年份错误"}
{"sample_id": "kn-006", "sut_id": "mock-strong", "score": 5, "notes": "CAP 表述准确，并补充了 PACELC 的延伸"}
{"sample_id": "kn-006", "sut_id": "mock-weak", "score": 1, "notes": "答非所问"}
{"sample_id": "kn-007", "sut_id": "mock-strong", "score": 4, "notes": "抓住了置换等变性这个关键点，但对后果的解释略简"}
